    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-06-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第6题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-06",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（20联考）植树节期间，某单位购进一批树苗，在林场工人的指导下组织员工植树造林。假设植树的成活率为80%，那么，该单位职工小张种植3棵树苗，至少成活2棵的概率是：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "27/125"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "48/125"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "64/125"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "112/125"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          140
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          134
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-06-p140.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 实战精刷6 · 讲义第134页",
            "pdfPage": 140
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-06-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-06",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把每棵树按相同成活率且相互独立的重复试验处理。至少成活2棵，包括恰好2棵和3棵全活。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "恰好2棵的概率3×0.8²×0.2=0.384，全活0.8³=0.512，合计0.896=112/125。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=\\binom32(0.8)^2(0.2)+(0.8)^3=\\frac{112}{125}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以我们选D。只算恰好2棵会误选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
