    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25联考）小王、小李参加某项知识竞赛答题，小王每题答对的概率相等，且均为小李的1.5倍。已知小王连续答对2题的概率比小李高0.2，问小王前2题全对且小李前2题全错的概率在以下哪个范围内？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "不到0.05"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "0.05~0.08"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "0.08~0.11"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "0.11以上"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          141
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          135
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-08-p141.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第135页",
            "pdfPage": 141
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-08-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-08",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设小李每题答对概率为p，则小王是1.5p。按各次答题独立的重复试验模型，连续答对2题的概率差为（1.5p）²−p²=0.2。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "解得p=0.4，小王为0.6。小王前2题全对概率0.36，小李前2题全错概率也为0.6²=0.36。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "(1.5p)^2-p^2=0.2\\Rightarrow p=0.4,\\quad P=(0.6)^2(1-0.4)^2=0.1296"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两件事同时发生，概率0.36²=0.1296，超过0.11，我们选D。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
